    trustCenterOpen: 'What we calculate, what we don\'t',
    trustCenterTitle: 'Trust Center',
    trustCenterSub: 'No guessed numbers. Here\'s what Momentum actually calculates, what it doesn\'t, and how your data stays yours.',
    trustLimitiTitle: 'What we don\'t calculate, and why',
    trustLimitCasse: 'Real pension contributions only for 9 of 17 Italian professional funds (lawyers, engineers/architects, accountants, surveyors, doctors/dentists, psychologists, nurses, labor consultants, biologists) — the rest stay at zero with a note, never a guessed number. For doctors (ENPAM) the maternity contribution isn\'t included: sources disagree on the exact amount.',
    trustLimitSdi: 'We don\'t transmit the e-invoice to Italy\'s Sistema di Interscambio, or the F24 form to the tax authorities: everything is prepared, sending stays with you (or your accountant).',
    trustLimitCantoni: 'Swiss cantonal and municipal taxes (26 cantons, each with its own rates) aren\'t calculated: it needs your municipality\'s real data.',
    trustLimitAvsDegressiva: 'Below CHF 60,500/year, AHV applies a sliding scale calculated by your compensation office, not by us — we only show the verified minimum.',
    trustLimitAutonomica: 'The Spanish IRPF shown is only the state bracket: the regional share (17 comunidades autónomas, each with its own) is missing.',
    trustLimitForal: 'In the Basque Country and Navarre, IRPF follows a separate foral system we don\'t calculate: only RETA stays correct everywhere.',
    trustCancelTitle: 'Cancellation is always instant and reversible',
    trustCancelDesc: 'Turn Italian VAT registration or Spanish tax tracking on or off whenever you want, right away, no email confirmation and no waiting — unlike some services we checked, where cancellation gets ignored for weeks.',
    trustDataTitle: 'Your data always stays yours',
    trustDataDesc: 'A plain, readable file you can save whenever you want — no proprietary format, no account to depend on to get your numbers back.',
    trustAiTitle: "We don't hallucinate tax rules",
    trustAiDesc: 'An independent study from September 2026 tested 18 popular AI models and found 57% wrong financial answers (up to 88% on complex questions) — calculation errors, outdated rates, invented rules. Momentum never asks an AI "what are the rules": every tax rate/threshold is verified against a primary source, the calculation is code, not generated text.',
    trustCenterClose: 'Close',
    trustCrossBorderTitle: 'Move country, don\'t switch apps',
    trustCrossBorderDesc: 'In our competitor research, none of the fiscal products we verified cover more than one country in the same account: move abroad and you start over with another service. Momentum already calculates Italy, Switzerland and Spain in one place.',
