    fewMinutes: 'A few minutes',
    sdiChkId: 'SPID, CIE, CNS or Entratel/Fisconline credentials',
    sdiHowUpload: 'How to upload it (once, then it\'s routine)',
    sdiStep1: 'Log in to the <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">Fatture e Corrispettivi</b> portal with SPID, CIE, CNS or your Entratel/Fisconline credentials. If after login you land on another page (e.g. "Registrazione indirizzo telematico"), you didn\'t do anything wrong: look for the <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">"torna a Fatture e Corrispettivi"</b> link at the top and start again from there.',
    sdiStep2: 'On the first screen choose the <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">"Me stesso"</b> (myself) profile: you\'re the one invoicing, not another person or company. This is where most people get stuck: if you see a list of companies or delegations, "Me stesso" is always the first option at the top.',
    sdiStep3Pre: 'Don\'t search the menu:',
    sdiStep3Link: 'open the transmission service directly',
    sdiStep3Post: '(works only if you\'ve completed step 1 above).',
    sdiStep5: 'Check the preview and press <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">Trasmetti</b> (send): the SdI will send you the delivery receipt (or the rejection, explained in plain words above before you even send).',
    sdiMenuNames: 'Exact menu names may change over time: look for "Fatturazione elettronica" in the menu.',
    sdiGuideMe: 'Guide me step by step, one screen at a time',
    sdiNoSpid: 'No SPID or can\'t log in? There\'s a second way: PEC',
    sdiPecIntro: 'If you have a <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">PEC (certified email)</b> mailbox, you can send the XML file as an attachment directly to the Sistema di Interscambio, without the portal:',
    sdiPec1: 'The <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">first time</b>, send an email from your PEC with the XML file attached to <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">sdi01@pec.fatturapa.it</b>.',
    sdiPec2: 'The SdI will reply with a <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">dedicated PEC-SdI address</b> of your own: use it for <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">all later submissions</b> (no longer the first address).',
    sdiPec3: 'Keep the receipts you get: they say whether the invoice was delivered or rejected.',
    sdiPecWarn: 'Careful: sending the file straight to the client\'s PEC without going through the SdI does NOT count as an e-invoice: it always goes to the SdI first.',
    sdiReceiveQ: 'Also want to receive your suppliers\' invoices automatically? (optional, once)',
    sdiReceiveBody: 'This guide helps you <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">send</b> the invoice you created: that\'s different from <b class="text-[var(--on-surface)]">receiving</b> your suppliers\'. On the same portal there\'s a separate section, "Registrazione dell\'indirizzo telematico", where you tell the Agency where to deliver incoming invoices (recipient code or PEC). It\'s not mandatory (without it, incoming invoices still land in your tax drawer), but if you see it after login you now know what it is: a separate setting, not an error.',
    pivaExpertHide: 'Hide the legal references',
    sdiRef: 'Legal reference: general e-invoicing obligation between private parties since 1 January 2019, L. 205/2017 (2018 Budget Law), art. 1 paragraphs 909–928. SdI technical rules: DM 55/2013.',
    sdiCannotSend: 'Momentum prepares the file and shows the exact route, but can\'t press "Trasmetti" for you: it needs your official login, which we never see.',
